WEBVTT

00:46:24.348 --> 00:46:30.971
is that a lot of what shapes history
is scientific and technological;

00:46:30.995 --> 00:46:36.713
it's people who engage in the art
of changing what is possible.

00:46:36.737 --> 00:46:40.875
It's changing, if you like,
the shape of the adjacent possible.

00:46:40.899 --> 00:46:46.860
But, that is in flat contradiction
to every media agenda.

00:46:46.884 --> 00:46:51.566
Like, the entire front page
of every newspaper

00:46:51.590 --> 00:46:54.120
and the first hour of every cable show

00:46:54.144 --> 00:46:56.199
is all in the politics of the moment.

00:46:56.223 --> 00:46:59.841
It's the incremental "Who did
what that was outrageous this time?

00:46:59.865 --> 00:47:03.241
Just how angry are they?
How scandalous is it?"